Error [E0957]: `embed_bytes` path must be a string literal
  --> tests/ui/comptime_embed_bytes_nonliteral.jet:1:7
    |
  1 | $d :: embed_bytes("a" + "b")
    |       ^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a computed path can't be audited at build time, so the compiler can't tell which file it reads
 Fix: pass the path inline, e.g. `embed_bytes("data/file")`
